
---

**.gitattributes**

```gitattributes
# Force GitHub to show only JavaScript as the primary language
# by marking all non-JS files as vendored or generated.

# Hide all non-JS files from language statistics
* linguist-vendored

# Keep JavaScript files detectable and counted
*.js linguist-vendored=false
*.js linguist-detectable=true

# Explicitly mark HTML, CSS, and other files as vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.md linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored
*.png linguist-vendored
*.jpg linguist-vendored
*.jpeg linguist-vendored
*.gif linguist-vendored
*.svg linguist-vendored
*.ico linguist-vendored
*.txt linguist-vendored
*.yml linguist-vendored
*.yaml linguist-vendored
*.xml linguist-vendored
*.lock linguist-vendored
*.gitattributes linguist-vendored
*.gitignore linguist-vendored
LICENSE linguist-vendored